                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What MRR should I hit by day 90?</h3>
                                        <p>Minimum viable: ₹10 lakh. Healthy: ₹15-25 lakh. Excellent: ₹25-50 lakh. Category-dependent.</p>
                                        <h3>How much should I spend in first 90 days?</h3>
                                        <p>Excluding inventory: ₹8-30 lakh realistic for a serious launch. ₹5-10 lakh possible bootstrapped with meaningful trade-offs.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I hit break-even by day 90?</h3>
                                        <p>Positive contribution margin by day 90 is realistic. Full break-even including team + fixed costs typically 6-18 months.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest first-90-days mistake?</h3>
                                        <p>Scaling paid spend before creative volume + attribution + lifecycle are ready. Wastes budget without proportional signal.</p>
